+[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mrouting_embedding[39m (skills route on a hand-written[53Gone-liner[63G+[65Gits[69Gembedding,[80Gnot[84Gon[87Gbody[92Gcontent[100G—[102Gprompts[110Groute[116Gon[119Gbody[124Gcontent[132G+[134Gtsvector).[2C[2BIf you're refining toward "correct overlap": the taxonomy triad + complexity + status is already the deliberate shared surface. The pl[138Gce I'[145Gs[147Gnity-check before [166Gouching anything is [38;2;177;185;249mcomplexity_level[39m on prompts [216Gving a DB co[229Gumn with no[241Gfrontmatter[2C[1Bpath[8Gin[11G—[13Geither[20Gthat's[27Gintentional[39G(classifier-only[56Gfield)[63Gor[66Git's[71Ga[73Gsync[78Ggap[82Gyou[86Gdidn't[93Gknow[98Gabout.[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GBrewed for 44s[39m[K[2B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mMy base /home/bao-tn/Documents/Obsidian/Main Vault/Bases/Prompt Database.base has the following mappings with Postgres: Complexity/complexity_level, prompt content (which clicking on Prompt)/prompt_text. That being said, does complexity even matter [39m   [1B  [38;2;255;255;255mfor helping with retrieval because I just need the right context to feed into the right retrieved prompts?[39m                                                                                                                                                  [2C[2B[49m[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for [1m1[22m pattern, read [1m1[22m file [39m[K[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mComplexity[14Gisn't[20Gpart[25Gof[28Gthe[32Gretrieval[42Granking[50Gat[53Gall[57G—[59Gno[62Gdense/sparse/RRF/rerank[86Gstage[92Gtouches[100Git.[104GIt[107Gshows[113Gup[116Gin[119Gexactly[127Gtwo[131Gplaces:[1B[K[2C[1B1.[6G[38;2;177;185;249m[1mretriever.py[39m filters[27G[22m([38;2;177;185;249mcomplexity_min[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mcomplexity_max[39m)[59G—[61Gan[64Goptional[73GWHERE[79Gclause,[87Gonly[92Gapplied[100Gif[103Ga[105Gcaller[112Gexplicitly[123Gpasses[130Git.[134GNothing[142Gin[145Gyour[150Gpipeline[159Gsets[164Gthis[169Gautomatically.[1B  2. [38;2;177;185;249m[1mroute.py[39m's mode decision[22m ([38;2;177;185;249m_determine_prefer_mode[39m) — [38;2;177;185;249mcomplexity >= 3[39m flips the orchestrator from [38;2;177;185;249mprefer_mode="single"[39m to [38;2;177;185;249m"skill"[39m, i.e. it decides whether to try recalling a multi-step [38;2;177;185;249mskills.skills[39m chain instead of just retrieving one prompt.[K[1B[K[2C[1B(Unrelated[14Gfalse[20Gcognate[28Gworth[34Gflagging:[44G[38;2;177;185;249mgate.py[39m's[54Glog[58Gline[63Gsays[68G"in[72Gcomplexity[83Gband"[89Gbut[93Gthat's[100Gword-count[111Gbanding[119Gon[122Gthe[126Gincoming[135Gmessage,[144Gnothing[152Gto[155Gdo[158Gwith[163G[38;2;177;185;249mprompts.complexity_level[188G[39m—[190Gdifferent[200Gsignal,[208Gsame[213Gword.)[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSo:[7Gif[10Gwhat[15Gyou[19Gactually[28Gneed[33Gis[36G"feed[42Gthe[46Gright[52Gcontext[60Ginto[65Gthe[69Gright[75Gretrieved[85Gprompt,"[94Gcomplexity_level[111Gdoesn't[119Gtouch[125Gthat[130Gpath[135G—[137Gdense+sparse+rerank[157Gproduce[165Gthe[169Granking[177Gindependent[189Gof[192Git.[196GIt[199Gonly[204Gmatters[212Gif[215Gyou're[222Gusing[228Gthe[232Gsingle-vs-skill[248Grouting[1B [3Gbranch [11Gn [38;2;177;185;249mroute.py[39m, where it's [35Ghe trigger for[50G"[52Ghis is[59Gc[61Gmplex enough to try a chain ins[93Gead of[100Gone[104Gprompt."[113G[K[2C[2BGiven that, keeping the[27GObsidian↔DB mapping is low-cost[59Gbut arguably not pulling weight for retrieval[105Gqua[109Gity s[115Gecifically — it's a routing-mode heurist[156Gc,[159Gno[162G a relevance s[177Ggna[181G. If[186Gyou're[193Gnot[197Gexercising[208G[38;2;177;185;249magent.route[39m's[222Gskill-vs-single[238Gbranch[245G(or[249Gwant[2C[1Bthat decision to come from something else, like domain/stage), complexity_level is safe to leave unscored and even drop[124Ghe mapping[135Gwithou[143Ghurting[151Gretri[157Gval.[162G[K[2B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GSautéed for 21s[39m[K[2B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mDrop complexity level for both sides, then help me find alternative effective filters for retrieving a prompt vs skill[39m                                                                                                                                      [2C[1B[49m[K[2C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mRead [1m1[22m file [2C[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mOne clar[12Gfyi[16Gg point bef[28Gre I touch a [42Give[46GDB an[52G ~972 vault files.[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[1B[48;2;177;185;249m[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Drop scope [39m[49m[K[2B[38;2;255;255;255m[1mDropping complexity_level — how far should this go right now?[22m[39m[K[2B[38;2;177;185;249m❯[3G[38;2;153;153;153m1.[39m [38;2;177;185;249mCode only (recommended)[5C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mRemove complexity_level from schema-creation code, mappings, filters, and routing logic. Stop writing/reading it going forward. Leave the existing DB column and Obsidian 'Complexity' frontmatter values in place untouched — inert, droppable later.[1B[39m [3G[38;2;153;153;153m2.[39m Code + DB colum[22G drop[K[5C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mAbove, plus run ALTER TABLE DROP COLUMN complexity_level on the live prompts and skills.skills tables in Postgres. Irreversible without a backup.[1B[39m [3G[38;2;153;153;153m3.[39m Code + DB + vault frontmatter[K[1B     [38;2;153;153;153mAll of the above, plus strip the 'Comp[45Gexity' key ou[59G of frontmat[72Ger[75Gacross th[8