8;2;177;185;249mdraft[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mactive[39m/[38;2;177;185;249minactive[72G[39m—[74Gnote:[80Gno[83G[38;2;177;185;249mdeprecated[39m/[38;2;177;185;249marchived[103G[39mdespite[111G[38;2;177;185;249mskills_schema_design.md[135G[39mdocumenting[147Gthose;[154G[38;2;177;185;249msetup_skills.py[170G[39mis[173Gthe[177Greal,[183Gcurrent[191Gconstraint),[204G[38;2;177;185;249mcreated_by[39m,[216G[38;2;177;185;249mrouting_embedding[39m.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BPlus[8G[38;2;177;185;249mskills.skill_runs[39m,[27G[38;2;177;185;249mskills.skill_sessions[39m,[50G[38;2;177;185;249mskills.agent_feedback[39m,[73Gand[77Ga[79Gmaterialized[92Gview[97G[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_quality_prior[39m.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mOverlap vs. difference, for your refinement pass[22m[K[3C[2B[1mhared vocabulary (same shape, same semantics):[22m [38;2;177;185;249mdomain[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mintent[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mtask_type[39m (varchar[]), [38;2;177;185;249mcomplexity_level[39m (1-5 CHECK), [38;2;177;185;249mstatus[39m (though the al[140Gowed values differ: prompts use [38;2;177;185;249mdraft/active/inactive[39m, same for skills — that one actually matches).[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mPrompts-only:[17G[22mraw[21Gcontent[29G([38;2;177;185;249mprompt_text[39m),[44Gfile[49Gprovenance[60G([38;2;177;185;249mfile_path[39m,[72G[38;2;177;185;249mcontent_hash[39m,[86G[38;2;177;185;249mfile_mtime[39m),[99Gclassification[114Gbookkeeping[126G([38;2;177;185;249mmetadata_confidence[39m,[148G[38;2;177;185;249mclassification_version[39m,[172G[38;2;177;185;249mbackfill_status[39m),[190Gfull[195Gretrieval[205Gstack[211G([38;2;177;185;249membedding[39m,[223G[38;2;177;185;249msearch_tsv[39m),[236GObsidian-facing[2C[1Bfields ([38;2;177;185;249moriginal_link[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mnotes[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mlast_evaluated[39m, [38;2;177;185;249msummary[39m).[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mSkills-only:[16G[22mcomposition[28G([38;2;177;185;249msteps[35G[39mJSONB[41Greferencing[53G[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_id[39ms),[66Gidentity/versioning[86G([38;2;177;185;249mslug[39m,[93G[38;2;177;185;249mversion[39m,[102G[38;2;177;185;249mchangelog[39m,[113G[38;2;177;185;249mparent[39m-style[126Glineage[134Gvia[138Gslug+version),[153Goutcome[161Gtracking[170G([38;2;177;185;249msuccess_rate[39m,[185G[38;2;177;185;249mtotal_runs[39m,[197G[38;2;177;185;249mskill_runs[39m,[209G[38;2;177;185;249magent_feedback[39m),[226G[38;2;177;185;249mrouting_description[246G[39m+[1B [3G[38;2;177;185;249mrouting_embedding[21G[39m(skills[29Groute[35Gon[38Ga[40Ghand-written[53Gone-liner[63G+[65Gits[69Gembedding,[80Gnot[84Gon[87Gbody[92Gcontent[100G—[102Gprompts[110Groute[116Gon[119Gbody[124Gcontent[132G+[134Gtsvector).[2B  If you're refining toward "correct overlap": the taxonomy triad + complexity + status is already the deliberate shared surface. The place I'd sanity-check before touching anything is [38;2;177;185;249mcomplexity_level[39m on prompts having a DB column with no frontmatter[K[1B  path in — either that's intentional (classifier-only field) or it's a sync gap you didn't know about.[K[2B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GBrewed for 44s[39m[K[2B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mMy base /home/bao-tn/Documents/Obsidian/Main Vault/Bases/Prompt Database.base has the following mappings with Postgres: Complexity/complexity_level, prompt content (which clicking on Prompt)/prompt_text. That being said, does complexity even matter [39m   [1B  [38;2;255;255;255mfor helping with retrieval because I just need the right context to feed into the right retrieved prompts?[39m                                                                                                                                                  [2C[1B[49m[K[2C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for [1m1[22m pattern, read [1m1[22m file [39m[K[2B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mComplexity[14Gisn't[20Gpart of[28Gthe retrieval ranking at a[55Gl — no dense/sparse/RRF/rerank stage touche[100Git. It shows up in[119Gexactly tw[130G places:[K[2C[2B1. [38;2;177;185;249m[1mretriever.py[39m filters[22m ([38;2;177;185;249mcomplexity_min[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mcomplexity_max[39m) — an optional WHERE clause, [88Gnly applied if a caller explici[120Gly passes[130Git. Nothi[140Gg in your pipeline sets this[169Gautomatically.[K[2C[1B2. [38;2;177;185;249m[1mroute.py[39m's mode decision[22m ([38;2;177;185;249m_determine_prefer_mode[39m)[56G— [38;2;177;185;249mcomplexity >= 3[74G[39mflips the orchestrator[97Gfrom [38;2;177;185;249mprefer_mode="single"[123G[39mto[126G[38;2;177;185;249m"skill"[39m,[135Gi.e.[140Git[143Gdecides[151Gwhether[159Gto[162Gtry[166Grecalling[176Ga[178Gmulti-step[189G[38;2;177;185;249mskills.skills[203G[39mchain[209Ginstead[217Gof[220Gjust[225Gretrieving[236Gone[240Gprompt.[2C[2B(Unrelated false cognate worth flagging: [38;2;177;185;249mgate.py[39m's l[56Gg line[63Gsays "in[72Gc[74Gmplexity band" but that's word-count banding on the[126Gincoming[135Gmessage, nothing to do with[163G[38;2;177;185;249mprompts.complexity_level[39m — different signal,[208Gsame word.)[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSo:[7Gif[10Gwhat[15Gyou[19Gactually[28Gneed[33Gis[36G"feed[42Gthe[46Gright[52Gcontext[60Ginto[65Gthe[69Gright[75Gretrieved[85Gprompt,"[94Gcomplexity_level[111Gdoesn't[119Gtouch[125Gthat[130Gpath[135G—[137Gdense+sparse+rerank[157Gproduce[165Gthe[169Granking[177Gindependent[189Gof[192Git.[196GIt[199Gonly[204Gmatters[212Gif[215Gyou're[222Gusing[228Gthe[232Gsingle-vs-skill[248Grouting[1B [3Gbranch in [38;2;177;185;249mroute.py[39m,[23Gwhere[29Git's[34Gthe[38Gtrigger[46Gfor[50G"this[56Gis[59Gcomplex[67Genough[74Gto[77Gtry[81Ga[83Gchain[89Ginstead[97Gof[100Gone[104Gprompt."[2B  Given that, keeping the Obsidian↔DB mapping is low-cost but arguably not pulling weight for retrieval quality specifically — it's a routing-mode heuristic, not a relevance signal. If you're not exercising [38;2;177;185;249magent.route[39m's skill-vs-single branch (or want[K[2C[1Bthat[8Gdecision[17Gto[20Gcome[25Gfrom[30Gsomething[40Gelse,[46Glike[51Gdomain/stage),[66Gcomplexity_level[83Gis[86Gsafe[91Gto[94Gleave[100Gunscored[109Gand[113Geven[118Gdrop[123Gthe[127Gmapping[135Gwithout[143Ghurting[151Gretrieval.[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GSautéed for 21s[1B[39m[K[1B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mDrop complexity level for both sides, then help me find alternative effective filters for retrieving a prompt vs skill[39m                                                                                                                                      [1B[49m[K[2C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mRead [1m1[22m file [1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mOne[7Gclarifying[18Gpoint[24Gbefore[31GI[33Gtouch[39Ga[41Glive[46GDB[49Gand[53G~972[58Gvault[64Gfiles.[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m● [39mUser answered Claude's questions:[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · Dropping complexity_level — how far should this go right now? → Code only (recommended)[5C[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;215;119;87m·[3G[38;2;230;149;117mCombobulating…[38;2;215;119;87m [38;2;153;153;153m(43s · ↓[39m [38;2;153;153;153m3.9k tokens)[1B  ⎿  Tip: See an artifact you'd like to bui[45Gd on? Duplica[59Ge, in its ti[72Gle[75Gmenu, giv[85Gs you your own editable copy.[39m[K[2C[1B                  [236G[38;2;153;153;153m◐ medium · /effort[1B[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────