rs wi[85Ghout[90G[38;2;177;185;249manalyze[39m.[99GThis[104Gis[107Gthe[111Gstrongest[121Gmerge[127Gcandidate[137G—[139Gfolding[147G[38;2;177;185;249mevaluate[156G[39minto[161G[38;2;177;185;249manalyze[169G[39mloses[175Gsignal[182Gon[185Gonly[190G33[193Gprompts[201G(11%).[241G│[2C[1B├──────────────────────────────┼───────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ task_type [38;2;177;185;249mdesign[39m ↔ [38;2;177;185;249mgenerate[39m  │ 65% / 46%     │ Real overlap but each still carries independent signal (design-without-generate and generate-without-design are both common). Not a clean merge.                                             │[2C[1B├──────────────────────────────┼───────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ domain [38;2;177;185;249mstrategy[39m → [38;2;177;185;249mbusiness[39m   │ 85/132 = [1m64%[22m  │ Weaker case than evaluate/analyze, but [38;2;177;185;249mstrategy[39m is heavily nested in [38;2;177;185;249mbusiness[39m. 47 prompts (36%) are non-business strategy (e.g. [38;2;177;185;249mAI[39m+[38;2;177;185;249mstrategy[39m), so merging loses more than the task_type case. │[2C[1B├──────────────────────────────┼───────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ intent [38;2;177;185;249mvalidate[39m ↔ [38;2;177;185;249mimprove[39m    │ 51% / 36%     │ Correlated but not redundant — [38;2;177;185;249mimprove[39m without [38;2;177;185;249mvalidate[39m is the majority case (180/280 = 64%). Keep both.                                                                                     │[2C[1B└──────────────────────────────┴───────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[2C[1B[K[2C[1BEverything else I[21Gchecked ([38;2;177;185;249mbuild[39m↔[38;2;177;185;249mcommunicate[39m,[49G[38;2;177;185;249mAI[39m↔[38;2;177;185;249mtechnical[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mAI[39m↔[38;2;177;185;249mbusiness[39m) has real independent var[101Ganc[105G in both directions — not[131Gredundan[140G,[142Gjust prompts that l[162Ggitimately span two categories.[194G[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mLong tail (thin, not necessarily redundant)[50G[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B-[5G[1mintent[22m:[13G[38;2;177;185;249mautomate[39m(36),[27G[38;2;177;185;249madapt[39m(33),[38G[38;2;177;185;249mreflect[39m(25)[50G—[52Geach[57Gdistinct[66Gfrom[71Gthe[75Gothers[82Gin[85Gwhat[90Gco-occurs[100Gwith[105Gthem,[111Gjust[116Grare.[2C[1B- [1mtask_type[22m: [38;2;177;185;249moptimize[39m(18), [38;2;177;185;249mcompare[39m(15), [38;2;177;185;249mdebug[39m(7) — same story, real but t[77Gin.[K[2C[1B-[5G[1mdomain[22m:[13G[38;2;177;185;249mfinance[39m(65),[26G[38;2;177;185;249mwriting[39m(62),[39G[38;2;177;185;249mcareer[39m(57)[50G—[52Gnot[56Gthin[61Grelative[70Gto[73Gthe[77Gothers,[85Gkeep.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThese[9Garen't[16Gredundant[26Gwith[31Ganything[40G—[42Gmerging[50Gthem[55Gwould[61Glose[66Greal[71Gdistinctions,[85Gnot[89Goverlap.[98GWorth[104Gnoting:[112G[38;2;177;185;249mroute.py[121G[39mexplicitly[132Gdoes[137G[1mnot[141G[22muse[145Gdomain/intent/task_type[169Gas[172Ghard[177Gretrieval[187Gfilters[195G(embeddings[207G+[209Greranker[218Ghandle[225Grelevance[235Gbetter[242Gthan[247Garray[2C[1Boverlap),[13Gso the only pla